<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { font-size: 24px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .content { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #555; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">Event Rejected ❌</div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Dear {{ event.user.email }},</p>
            <p>We regret to inform you that your event <strong>{{ event.nom }}</strong> has been rejected.</p>
            <p>Event Details:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Type: {{ event.type }}</li>
                <li>Location: {{ event.lieuEvenement }}</li>
                <li>Dates: {{ event.dateDebut|date('M j, Y') }} to {{ event.dateFin|date('M j, Y') }}</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Please contact support for more information.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>